{title: You Parents Hear What Jesus Taught}
{artist: Ludwig Helmbold · tr. William Martin Czamanske}
{key: F}
{time: 3/2}
{tempo: 125}

Verse 1
You parents, hear what Jesus taught When little
ones to him were brought: Forbid them not, but
heed my plea Permitting them to come to me.

Verse 2
Obey your Lord and let his truth Be taught your
children in their youth That they in church and
school may dwell And learn their Savior's praise to tell.

Verse 3
For if you love them as you ought, To Christ your
children will be brought. If thus you place them
in his care, All in your family well shall fare.
